<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>ICONIC BY MISTAKE</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">LE SSERAFIM, ILLIT, KATSEYE</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">ICONIC BY MISTAKE</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">6fl4Gu0lJm5hc8FM5JzCZD</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.110" end="00:09.640">Hatin' me is like all you do, breakfast to dinner</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.640" end="00:12.980">Algorithm bulletproof, b-breakin' your fingers</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.980" end="00:16.000">Thank you for the comments, it's because of all your hate</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.000" end="00:19.280">I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I am iconic by mistake</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.280" end="00:22.380">I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I am iconic by mistake</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.380" end="00:25.250">Engrave it on my tombstone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.250" end="00:28.440">I, I survived the fame and I barely changed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.440" end="00:31.690">Heart, heart it, heart it harder</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.690" end="00:35.250">Here, heart is like a verb, come heal it where it hurts</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.250" end="00:38.410">Your imagination got me goin' viral</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.410" end="00:41.690">Life's a simulation, got me in a spiral</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.690" end="00:44.650">24-7, more like 25-8</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.650" end="00:47.720">Ho-honestly, are you okay?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.720" end="00:51.320">Hatin' me is like all you do, breakfast to dinner</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.320" end="00:54.440">Algorithm bulletproof, b-breakin' your fingers</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.440" end="00:57.680">Thank you for the comments, it's because of all your hate</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.680" end="01:00.840">I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I am iconic by mistake</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.840" end="01:04.180">I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I am iconic by mistake</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.180" end="01:07.440">Never off duty, duty, takin' a beatin', beatin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.440" end="01:10.540">I keep on cheesin', cheesin', looks are deceivin', deceivin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.540" end="01:13.790">Act like you knew me, know me, flappin' your lips, foamin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.790" end="01:16.990">I just keep on goin', too beautiful to be broken</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.990" end="01:20.150">Your imagination got me goin' viral</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.150" end="01:23.340">Life's a simulation, got me in a spiral</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.340" end="01:26.510">24-7, more like 25-8</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.510" end="01:29.230">Honestly, are you okay?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.230" end="01:32.860">Hatin' me is like all you do, breakfast to dinner</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.860" end="01:36.050">Algorithm bulletproof, b-breakin' your fingers</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.050" end="01:39.350">Thank you for the comments, it's because of all your hate</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.350" end="01:42.400">I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I am iconic by mistake</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.400" end="01:45.760">I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I am iconic by mistake</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.760" end="01:48.700">I'm just tryna stay me, dance a little crazy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.700" end="01:52.090">But now I am iconic from how much you fuckin' hate me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.090" end="01:55.360">Snap my neck, 360, demandin' me in 5D</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.360" end="01:58.980">Do this for the dream, nah, nah, not just for the bag</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.980" end="02:02.070">(Ay) but the bag is nice though</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.070" end="02:05.220">(Ay) and I'm so grateful</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.220" end="02:08.120">(Wait) I'm gettin' kinda spiritual</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.120" end="02:11.370">Been to hell and back, let 'em judge me, crucible</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.370" end="02:14.460">Your imagination got me goin' viral</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.460" end="02:17.740">Life's a simulation, got me in a spiral</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.740" end="02:20.770">24-7, more like 25-8</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.770" end="02:23.720">Honestly, are you okay?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.720" end="02:26.860">Your digital footprint is lookin' so insane</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.860" end="02:30.480">Hatin' me is like all you do, breakfast to dinner</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.480" end="02:33.760">Algorithm bulletproof, b-breakin' your fingers</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.760" end="02:36.850">Thank you for the comments, it's because of all your hate</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.850" end="02:40.130">I-I-I-I-I-I-I-I am iconic by mistake</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.130" end="02:46.540">I-I-I-I-I-I-I (I), I-I-I-I-I-I-I (I)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.540" end="02:52.800">I-I-I-I-I-I-I (I), I-I-I-I-I-I-I (I)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:52.800" end="02:56.380">I-I-I-I-I-I-I, I-I-I-I-I-I-I (I)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:56.380" end="03:00.380" /></div></body></tt>